Or don't add any legacy or fallback code because models, or at least some models, love
或不要添加任何遺留或後備程式碼，因為模型或至少某些模型喜歡

260
00:17:44,328 --> 00:17:44,761
to do that.
這樣做。

261
00:17:45,194 --> 00:17:50,676
They don't delete code, they just add layer on layer on layer and having such instructions
他們不會刪除程式碼，他們只是一層一層地添加並有這樣的指令

262
00:17:50,676 --> 00:17:53,932
in AgentsMD can help a bit at least.
AgentsMD 中至少可以提供一點幫助。

263
00:17:54,092 --> 00:17:55,665
Now, why not make it a skill?
現在，為什麼不把它變成一項技能呢？

264
00:17:55,954 --> 00:17:57,847
Because a skill must be activated.
因為必須發動技能。

265
00:17:58,200 --> 00:18:00,447
And I don't want to hope for that to be activated.
我不希望它被激活。

266
00:18:00,688 --> 00:18:05,550
If I have hard rules that matter to all the models and all the agents, I put them into
如果我有對所有模型和所有代理都很重要的硬性規則，我會將它們放入

267
00:18:05,582 --> 00:18:10,187
a global agents.md file because you can have global agents and Claude.md files too, not
全域代理.md 文件，因為您也可以擁有全域代理程式和 Claude.md 文件，而不是

268
00:18:10,236 --> 00:18:11,616
just project-specific ones.
只是特定於項目的。

269
00:18:12,241 --> 00:18:15,162
And then they will be loaded for every session and I'm good to go.
然後每次會話都會加載它們，我就可以開始了。

270
00:18:15,692 --> 00:18:17,746
And that's the simple differentiation here for me.
這對我來說就是簡單的差別。

271
00:18:17,794 --> 00:18:23,855
Skills are like tools, like extra patterns or pieces of knowledge that matter often,
技能就像工具，就像經常重要的額外模式或知識片段，

272
00:18:24,129 --> 00:18:25,062
but not always.
但並非總是如此。

273
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:29,920
If something does matter always, it goes into AgentsMD or ClaudeMD.
如果某件事確實很重要，那麼它就會進入 AgentsMD 或 ClaudeMD。

274
00:18:30,788 --> 00:18:35,582
Yeah, and that is really how you should be using skills in my opinion.
是的，在我看來，這確實是你應該如何使用技能的方式。
